                                                        <option value="6">6 Months</option>
                                                        <option value="Other">Other</option>
                                                    </Select>
                                                    {isFieldReadOnly && <LockClosedIcon className="absolute right-8 top-[34px] w-4 h-4 text-gray-400 pointer-events-none" />}
                                                </div>

                                                {(!isInitialized || isUnlocked) && (
                                                    <div className="pt-2">
                                                        <Button 
                                                            onClick={handleFormSubmit} 
                                                            disabled={!selectedClient || isSaving} 
                                                            className="w-full"
                                                            isLoading={isSaving}
                                                        >
                                                            Save Record
                                                        </Button>
                                                    </div>
                                                )}
                                            </div>
                                        </Card>
                                        <div className={`p-4 rounded-lg flex items-start gap-3 border ${selectedClient.payment.paid / selectedClient.payment.total >= 0.7 ? 'bg-green-50 border-green-200 text-green-800' : 'bg-amber-50 border-amber-200 text-amber-800'}`}>
                                            <ExclamationTriangleIcon className="w-6 h-6 mt-0.5" />
                                            <div>
                                                <h4 className="font-bold text-sm">Allocation Status</h4>
                                                <p className="text-xs mt-1">Paid: {((selectedClient.payment.paid / selectedClient.payment.total) * 100).toFixed(1)}%. (Requires 70%)</p>
                                                {roles && roles.find(r => r.id === currentStaff?.roleId)?.name === 'Administrator' && (
                                                    <Button size="sm" className="mt-2" disabled={selectedClient.payment.paid / selectedClient.payment.total < 0.7}>Allocate Plot Now</Button>
                                                )}
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div className="space-y-6">
                                        <Card title="Quick Actions">
                                            <Button className="w-full" variant="success" icon={<BanknotesIcon className="w-5 h-5"/>} onClick={() => setPaymentModalOpen(true)}>Record a Payment</Button>
                                            <p className="text-[10px] text-gray-500 mt-2 text-center">New payments update balances immediately.</p>
                                        </Card>
                                        {calculatedTotal && calculatedTotal > parseFloat(landPrice) && (
                                            <div className="p-4 bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-900/30 rounded-lg border border-indigo-100 dark:border-indigo-800">
                                                <h4 className="text-xs font-bold text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-300 uppercase">Projected Installment Plan</h4>
                                                <InfoRow label="Total with Interest" value={formatCurrency(calculatedTotal)} />
                                                <InfoRow label="Monthly Installment" value={formatCurrency(calculatedTotal / (parseInt(paymentOption) || 1))} />
                                            </div>
                                        )}
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            )}

                            {activeTab === 'history' && (
                                <div className="space-y-6">
                                    <Card title="Payment History" className="p-0">
                                        <div className="overflow-x-auto">
                                            <table className="w-full text-sm text-left">
                                                <thead className="text-xs uppercase bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700">
                                                    <tr>
                                                        <th className="px-4 py-3">Date</th><th className="px-4 py-3">Type</th><th className="px-4 py-3">Amount</th><th className="px-4 py-3">Receipt</th><th className="px-4 py-3 text-center">Status</th>
                                                    </tr>
                                                </thead>
                                                <tbody className="divide-y divide-gray-100 dark:divide-gray-600">
                                                    {selectedClient.payment.paymentHistory.map((p: any) => (
                                                        <tr key={p.id}>
                                                            <td className="px-4 py-3">{p.date}</td>
                                                            <td className="px-4 py-3"><Badge variant={p.type === 'Indenture' ? 'purple' : 'info'}>{p.type || 'Land'}</Badge></td>
                                                            <td className="px-4 py-3 font-bold">{formatCurrency(p.amount)}</td>
                                                            <td className="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-indigo-600">{p.receiptNumber}</td>
                                                            <td className="px-4 py-3 text-center">{getStatusBadge(p.status)}</td>
                                                        </tr>
                                                    ))}
                                                    {selectedClient.payment.paymentHistory.length === 0 && <tr><td colSpan={5} className="p-8 text-center text-gray-400">No transactions recorded yet.</td></tr>}
                                                </tbody>
                                            </table>
                                        </div>
                                    </Card>
                                </div>
                            )}

                            {activeTab === 'commission' && (
                                <Card title="Commission Status">
                                    <dl className="mb-6">
                                        <InfoRow label="Assigned Rep" value={selectedClient.officeUse.salesRep} />
                                        <InfoRow label="Commission Amount" value={formatCurrency(selectedClient.officeUse.commission.amount)} />
                                        <InfoRow label="Status" value={getStatusBadge(selectedClient.officeUse.commission.status)} />
                                    </dl>
                                    <Button 
                                        variant="success" 
                                        className="w-full"
                                        disabled={selectedClient.officeUse.commission.status === 'Paid'} 
                                        onClick={handleCommissionPaid}
                                    >
                                        Mark Commission as Paid
                                    </Button>
                                    {(selectedClient.payment as any).commissionHistory?.length > 0 && (
                                        <div className="mt-6 border-t pt-4">
                                            <h4 className="text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase mb-2">History</h4>
                                            {(selectedClient.payment as any).commissionHistory.map((h: any, i: number) => (
                                                <div key={i} className="text-xs flex justify-between py-1">
                                                    <span>{new Date(h.date).toLocaleDateString()}</span>
                                                    <span className="font-bold text-green-600">Paid {formatCurrency(h.amount)}</span>
                                                </div>
                                            ))}
                                        </div>
                                    )}
                                </Card>
                            )}
                        </div>
                    )}
                </div>
            </div>

            {selectedClient && (
                <RecordPaymentModal 
                    isOpen={isPaymentModalOpen} 
                    onClose={() => setPaymentModalOpen(false)} 
                    onSave={(p) => onRecordPayment(selectedClient, p)} 
                    client={selectedClient}
                />
            )}

            <ReAuthModal 
                isOpen={isAuthModalOpen} 
                onClose={() => setAuthModalOpen(false)} 
                onSuccess={() => setIsUnlocked(true)} 
            />

            {/* Success Confirmation Popup */}
            {showSuccessModal && (
                <div className="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/50 z-[100] flex justify-center items-center p-4 backdrop-blur-sm">
                    <Card className="w-full max-w-xs p-6 text-center animate-in zoom-in duration-200">
                        <div className="w-12 h-12 bg-green-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
                            <CheckCircleIcon className="w-6 h-6 text-green-600" />
                        </div>
                        <h3 className="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">New Record saved</h3>
                        <Button onClick={() => setShowSuccessModal(false)} className="w-full">OK</Button>
                    </Card>
                </div>
            )}

            <style>{`
                .scrollbar-thin::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; height: 6px; }
                .scrollbar-thin::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }
                .scrollbar-thin::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #cbd5e1; border-radius: 10px; }
                .dark .scrollbar-thin::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #475569; }
            `}</style>
        </div>
    );
};

payload.text:
The side-by-side positioning of the "Payment Configuration" and "Quick Action" sections is caused by the use of a responsive grid layout (`lg:grid-cols-2`) in the `overview` tab container. On large screens, this layout logic forces the two primary content wrappers into separate columns.

### 1. Frontend Layout Adjustment Logic
To achieve a vertical stack, the grid container is transitioned to a flexbox column flow. By removing the column-specific wrapper `div` elements, all children are brought into a single document flow. This ensures that sections respect their declared order and expand to the full width of the parent container.

### 2. Layout Change Steps
1.  **Container Update**: The parent `div` in the `overview` tab is changed from a 2-column grid to a single-column vertical stack using `flex flex-col` and a consistent `gap-6`.
2.  **Flattening the DOM**: The intermediate `div` wrappers (previously serving as the "Left Column" and "Right Column") are removed.
3.  **Component Reordering**: The "Quick Actions" `Card` is repositioned to follow immediately after the "Payment Configuration" `Card`.
4.  **Information Grouping**: The "Allocation Status" and "Projected Installment Plan" indicators are placed at the bottom of the stack to serve as summary/status information following the primary configuration and action sections.

### 3. Layout Pseudocode (Platform-Agnostic)
```typescript
// Define the new single-column structure
CONTAINER (Display: Flex, Direction: Column, Spacing: 1.5rem) {
    SECTION (Payment Configuration Card) {
        Full Width, Vertical Padding
    }
    SECTION (Quick Actions Card) {
        Full Width, Vertical Padding
    }
    SECTION (Allocation Status Alert) {
        Full Width
    }
    SECTION (Projected Installment Plan Info) {
        Full Width
    }
}
```

### 4. Container & Alignment State
- **Width**: `w-full` (100%) for all child components.
- **Max Width**: An optional `max-w-3xl` wrapper is often used in vertical stacks to maintain readability on ultra-wide monitors, though children remain 100% of that constraint.
- **Flex Direction**: `flex-direction: column`.

